	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<note>[Anfang fehlt.]</note>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>[...] imponit.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Damnandi fuerunt turpes, obscaeni foedique <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>libelli omni scatentes impuritate atque inscitia <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>spurca, ac miror valde, qui factum sit, ut, cum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>censor ille procul tot in <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName>, in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> et <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> authores et libros viderit inveneritque <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>in prope et quasi sinu suo, ipsa inquam, illa <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> et quasi ob oculos <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>versantem et in ipsis fere manibus suis volutatum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>non deprehenderit libellum bene Sodomitice et Amorh<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ice scriptum et a quodam Curtio Novo impressum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>anno domini 38. Carminis istius Chanaanitici <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et Sodomitici titulus hic est: Capitolo di messer <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><persName>Giovanni della Casa</persName> sopra il forno, nec arbitror <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>probrosius nomini christiano et magis impurum in <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>orbe extare carmen.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sileant modo spurcissimorum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ethnicorum plus millies condemnata, exibilata et ex<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>plosa Priapeia; unus nobis ingeniosus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ille in arte Amorhea <persName>Ioannes della Casa</persName> scrib<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>endo restituit rem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Unde sane merito ipsi parsum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>est ab isto nostro censore, quisquis tandem is <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sit, qui ipsum inter impuros commemorare noluit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Illud vero non solus ego miror, sed optimus quisque <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>mecum magis admiratur illustrissimum <placeName ref="l1098">Florentinorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>principem Cosmam<note type="margin">a.R.: <persName>Cosmum</persName>?</note>, bonarum literarum, studiorum stu<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>diosorumque Mecaenatem multorum literis celebratum, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ineptos, barbaros et probrosos huiusmodi author<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>es non opprimere, quominus prodeant <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>in publicum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Etenim in fine libelli diserte appendit "<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>in <placeName ref="l1098">Florenza</placeName>."</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Verum ignorat procul dubio bonus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>princeps audacem istorum hominum contumaciam et ne<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>farios conatus; neque enim dubium est non pas<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>surum, si sciat, ut tot boni, docti, honesti et <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>pii <placeName ref="l822">Germaniae</placeName>, <placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName>, <placeName ref="l830">Angliae</placeName>, adde et <placeName ref="l834">Italiae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>viri charta illa dentata <placeName ref="l1098">Florentię</placeName> impressa <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>damnarentur non rei quidem leviculae, sed rei <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>omnium longe probrosissimae, crimine inquam haereseos, id <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>quod s. <persName>Hieronymus</persName> nunquam viro bono tacendum <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>existimavit, ut iam non commemorem mini<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>strorum ecclesiae contumeliam omnino coniunctam esse cum <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>piissimorum et potentissimorum principum amplissimarumque <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>rerumpublicarum infamia.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Unde utile mihi videretur, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>si admonerentur privatim boni viri in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ne quidvis promittant rabiosis illis rabulis <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>neve semper ad illa conniveant, quae aliquando plurimis <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>plurimum incommodare poterant.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Vivit enim, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>qui iuste iudicat, deus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vive et vale, colendissime <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>mi <persName ref="p3375">Vergeri</persName>, ora pro nobis dominum, ut nostro <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>benedicat ministerio sancto.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> mense <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>iunio anno domini 1553.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>Tuus <persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
